    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    \n    N = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    M = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    \n    adj = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    \n    for _ in range(M):\n        u = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        v = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        if u == v:\n            continue\n        adj[u].append(v)\n        adj[v].append(u)\n        \n    K = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    constraints = []\n    for _ in range(K):\n        x = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        y = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        constraints.append((x, y))\n        \n    Q = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    queries = []\n    for _ in range(Q):\n        p = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        q = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        queries.append((p, q))\n        \n    colors = [0] * (N + 1)\n    color = 1\n    valid = True\n    \n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        if colors[i] == 0:\n            colors[i] = color\n            q = deque([i])\n            while q:\n                u = q.popleft()\n                for v in adj[u]:\n                    if colors[v] == 0:\n                        colors[v] = color\n                        q.append(v)\n                    elif colors[v] != color:\n                        valid = False\n                        break\n                if not valid:\n                    break\n            color += 1\n            if not valid:\n                break\n                \n    if not valid:\n        for _ in range(Q):\n            print(\"No\")\n        return\n        \n    for p, q in queries:\n        if colors[p] == colors[q]:\n            print(\"No\")\n        else:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n```",
