      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\nMOD = 998244353\nHASH = ord('#')\nDOT = ord('.')\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    H = int(data[0])\n    W = int(data[1])\n    grid = data[2:2 + H]\n\n    comp = [[-1] * W for _ in range(H)]\n    comp_id = 0\n    green = 0\n\n    for i in range(H):\n        row = grid[i]\n        for j, ch in enumerate(row):\n            if ch == HASH:\n                green += 1\n                if comp[i][j] != -1:\n                    continue\n\n                comp[i][j] = comp_id\n                stack = [i * W + j]\n\n                while stack:\n                    p = stack.pop()\n                    x = p // W\n                    y = p - x * W\n\n                    if x > 0 and grid[x - 1][y] == HASH and comp[x - 1][y] == -1:\n                        comp[x - 1][y] = comp_id\n                        stack.append(p - W)\n                    if x + 1 < H and grid[x + 1][y] == HASH and comp[x + 1][y] == -1:\n                        comp[x + 1][y] = comp_id\n                        stack.append(p + W)\n                    if y > 0 and grid[x][y - 1] == HASH and comp[x][y - 1] == -1:\n                        comp[x][y - 1] = comp_id\n                        stack.append(p - 1)\n                    if y + 1 < W and grid[x][y + 1] == HASH and comp[x][y + 1] == -1:\n                        comp[x][y + 1] = comp_id\n                        stack.append(p + 1)\n\n                comp_id += 1\n\n    red = H * W - green\n    total_k = 0\n\n    for i in range(H):\n        row = grid[i]\n        comp_row = comp[i]\n        up = comp[i - 1] if i > 0 else None\n        down = comp[i + 1] if i + 1 < H else None\n\n        for j, ch in enumerate(row):\n            if ch == DOT:\n                seen = []\n\n                if up is not None:\n                    cid = up[j]\n                    if cid != -1:\n                        seen.append(cid)\n\n                if down is not None:\n                    cid = down[j]\n                    if cid != -1 and cid not in seen:\n                        seen.append(cid)\n\n                if j > 0:\n                    cid = comp_row[j - 1]\n                    if cid != -1 and cid not in seen:\n                        seen.append(cid)\n\n                if j + 1 < W:\n                    cid = comp_row[j + 1]\n                    if cid != -1 and cid not in seen:\n                        seen.append(cid)\n\n                total_k += len(seen)\n\n    numerator = (red * (comp_id + 1) - total_k) % MOD\n    ans = numerator * pow(red, MOD - 2, MOD) % MOD\n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
