      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    H = int(input_data[0])\n    W = int(input_data[1])\n    grid = input_data[2:]\n    \n    MOD = 998244353\n    \n    labels = [[-1] * W for _ in range(H)]\n    C = 0\n    \n    for r in range(H):\n        for c in range(W):\n            if grid[r][c] == '#' and labels[r][c] == -1:\n                labels[r][c] = C\n                queue = deque([(r, c)])\n                while queue:\n                    cr, cc = queue.popleft()\n                    if cr > 0 and grid[cr-1][cc] == '#' and labels[cr-1][cc] == -1:\n                        labels[cr-1][cc] = C\n                        queue.append((cr-1, cc))\n                    if cr < H - 1 and grid[cr+1][cc] == '#' and labels[cr+1][cc] == -1:\n                        labels[cr+1][cc] = C\n                        queue.append((cr+1, cc))\n                    if cc > 0 and grid[cr][cc-1] == '#' and labels[cr][cc-1] == -1:\n                        labels[cr][cc-1] = C\n                        queue.append((cr, cc-1))\n                    if cc < W - 1 and grid[cr][cc+1] == '#' and labels[cr][cc+1] == -1:\n                        labels[cr][cc+1] = C\n                        queue.append((cr, cc+1))\n                C += 1\n                \n    R_count = 0\n    total_new_C = 0\n    \n    for r in range(H):\n        for c in range(W):\n            if grid[r][c] == '.':\n                R_count += 1\n                adj = set()\n                if r > 0 and grid[r-1][c] == '#':\n                    adj.add(labels[r-1][c])\n                if r < H - 1 and grid[r+1][c] == '#':\n                    adj.add(labels[r+1][c])\n                if c > 0 and grid[r][c-1] == '#':\n                    adj.add(labels[r][c-1])\n                if c < W - 1 and grid[r][c+1] == '#':\n                    adj.add(labels[r][c+1])\n                \n                total_new_C = (total_new_C + C - len(adj) + 1) % MOD\n                \n    ans = (total_new_C * pow(R_count, MOD - 2, MOD)) % MOD\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
