      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sum_of_group_powers(nums):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    nums.sort()\n    S = 0          # S_j = sum_{i=0}^{j-1} nums[i] * 2^(j-1-i)\n    ans = 0\n    for val in nums:\n        val_mod = val % MOD\n        # contribution from subsets where val is the maximum\n        contrib = (val_mod * val_mod % MOD * val_mod)          # val^3  (subset [val] only)\n        contrib = (contrib + val_mod * val_mod % MOD * S) % MOD\n        ans = (ans + contrib) % MOD\n        # update S for next iteration\n        S = (2 * S + val_mod) % MOD\n    return ans\n```\n\nThis function sorts the array, iteratively computes the contribution of each element as the maximum of its subsets, updates the weighted sum `S`, and returns the final result modulo \\(10^9+7\\).",
