      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.buffer.readline\n    line = input()\n    if not line:\n        return\n    N = int(line)\n    t = [0] * N\n    x = [0] * N\n\n    for i in range(N):\n        ti, xi = map(int, input().split())\n        t[i] = ti\n        x[i] = xi\n\n    need = [0] * (N + 1)\n    pick = [0] * N\n\n    for i in range(N - 1, -1, -1):\n        if t[i] == 2:\n            need[x[i]] += 1\n        else:\n            if need[x[i]] > 0:\n                pick[i] = 1\n                need[x[i]] -= 1\n\n    if any(need):\n        print(-1)\n        return\n\n    have = [0] * (N + 1)\n    total = 0\n    K = 0\n\n    for i in range(N):\n        if t[i] == 1:\n            if pick[i]:\n                have[x[i]] += 1\n                total += 1\n                K = max(K, total)\n        else:\n            if have[x[i]] == 0:\n                print(-1)\n                return\n            have[x[i]] -= 1\n            total -= 1\n\n    ans = [str(pick[i]) for i in range(N) if t[i] == 1]\n    print(K)\n    print(\" \".join(ans))\n\nsolve()\n```",
