      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given a 0-indexed array nums of length n, returns the distinct difference array.\n    diff[i] is defined as the number of distinct elements in the prefix nums[0...i]\n    minus the number of distinct elements in the suffix nums[i+1...n-1].\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(nums)\n    diff = []\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        # Extract the prefix up to index i inclusive\n        prefix = nums[:i + 1]\n        # Extract the suffix starting from index i + 1\n        suffix = nums[i + 1:]\n        \n        # Count distinct elements in the prefix and suffix using sets\n        distinct_prefix = len(set(prefix))\n        distinct_suffix = len(set(suffix))\n        \n        # Calculate the difference and append to the result list\n        diff.append(distinct_prefix - distinct_suffix)\n        \n    return diff\n```",
