ime_factors(val):\n            if p in prime_to_index:\n                union(idx, prime_to_index[p])\n            else:\n                prime_to_index[p] = idx\n\n    # ---------- check connectivity ----------\n    root = find(0)\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if find(i) != root:\n            return False\n    return True\n```",
