      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    H = int(input_data[0])\n    W = int(input_data[1])\n    N = int(input_data[2])\n    T = input_data[3]\n    S = input_data[4:]\n    \n    dr, dc = 0, 0\n    path_set = {(0, 0)}\n    for char in T:\n        if char == 'L':\n            dc -= 1\n        elif char == 'R':\n            dc += 1\n        elif char == 'U':\n            dr -= 1\n        elif char == 'D':\n            dr += 1\n        path_set.add((dr, dc))\n        \n    path = list(path_set)\n    ans = 0\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if S[i][j] == '#':\n                continue\n            valid = True\n            for r, c in path:\n                ni, nj = i + r, j + c\n                if 0 <= ni < H and 0 <= nj < W:\n                    if S[ni][nj] == '#':\n                        valid = False\n                        break\n                else:\n                    valid = False\n                    break\n            if valid:\n                ans += 1\n                \n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    solve()\n```",
