    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "We are given 7 green and 8 white balls, so total balls = 15.  \nWe want the probability that both balls drawn simultaneously are of the same color.  \nThis can happen in two ways: both green or both white.\n\nNumber of ways to choose 2 green balls: C(7,2) = (7×6)/2 = 21  \nNumber of ways to choose 2 white balls: C(8,2) = (8×7)/2 = 28  \nTotal ways to choose any 2 balls: C(15,2) = (15×14)/2 = 105  \n\nSo, probability = (21 + 28) / 105 = 49 / 105 = 7 / 15  \n\n\\boxed{E}",
