      "generated_answer": "The system function $ H(j\\omega) = \\frac{j2\\omega}{1 + 2j\\omega} $ multiplied by the input Fourier transform $ \\pi[\\delta(\\omega+1) + \\delta(\\omega-1)] $ gives output spectrum. Evaluating at $ \\omega = \\pm1 $, we find $ H(j1) = \\frac{j2}{1 + j2} = \\frac{4}{5} + j\\frac{2}{5} $, so output is $ \\frac{4}{5}\\cos t - \\frac{2}{5}\\sin t $.  \nThis matches option A.  \n$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$",
