    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}\n\nThe study found that women perceived greater career threats from pregnancy and were significantly less likely to plan childbearing during residency; mediation analysis showed these threats accounted for most of the gender difference. Hence, perceived career threats explain why women delay childbearing.",
